// ATT&CK: T1566.002 — Phishing: Spearphishing Link
// Tactic: Initial Access
// Data source: UrlClickEvents (Defender for Office 365 Safe Links)
//
// Detects a user clicking through a Safe Links warning page anyway (or a
// link that Safe Links later reclassified as malicious after the click
// already happened) — the highest-priority phishing signal available,
// since it confirms both delivery AND user interaction, not just delivery.

UrlClickEvents
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where IsClickedThrough == true or ThreatTypes has "Phish" or ThreatTypes has "Malware"
| project TimeGenerated, AccountUpn, Url, ThreatTypes, IsClickedThrough, NetworkMessageId
| extend AlertSeverity = "Critical"
